<programme start="20261023182400 +0000" stop="20261023185300 +0000" channel="Boruto: Naruto Next Generations"><title lang="es">Boruto: Naruto Next Generations</title><sub-title lang="es">Odio creciente</sub-title><desc lang="es">Boruto y sus amigos logran salir triunfantes contra Funamushi, pero no pudieron disfrutar su victoria.</desc><credits><actor>Karen Vallejo</actor><actor>Azul Valadez</actor><actor>Alan Velazquez</actor><actor>Isabel Martiñón</actor><actor>Victor Ugarte</actor><actor>Montserrat Aguilar</actor></credits><date>20220515</date><category lang="es">Anime</category><category lang="es">Anime Series</category><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">15.248.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S16E249</episode-num><rating><value>TV-14</value></rating><icon src="https://images.pluto.tv/series/69e65a2b1aab98e5ee28f276/tile_1780325420554.jpg?fill=blur&amp;fit=fill&amp;fm=jpg&amp;h=660&amp;q=75&amp;w=660"/></programme>
