<programme start="20261023230000 +0000" stop="20261024020000 +0000" channel="ESPN U"><title lang="en">College Football</title><sub-title lang="en">Yale at Pennsylvania</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Quakers (2-3) host the Bulldogs (3-2) for an Ivy League matchup in Week 8 at Franklin Field. The Bulldogs fell 41-23 to the Rams and rely on QB Dante Reno who has 13 TDs, while the Quakers lost 28-27 to the Lions and look to QB Miles Teodecki.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Football</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191261_b_v12_ak.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261024020000 +0000" stop="20261024023000 +0000" channel="ESPN U"><title lang="en">TrueSouth</title><sub-title lang="en">Lexington, TN</sub-title><desc lang="en">Exploring the Whole Hog Triangle of Tennessee, where the old ways of cooking barbecue endure and two families work together to secure a future for this remnant of our rural past; defined by Lexington to the west, Parsons to the east, and Jacks Creek.</desc><category lang="en">Travel</category><category lang="en">Food</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p15917551_b_v11_ab.jpg"/></programme>
