<programme start="20261024030000 +0000" stop="20261024033000 +0000" channel="ESPN U"><title lang="en">TrueSouth</title><sub-title lang="en">Oklahoma City</sub-title><desc lang="en">Exploring the oil and cattle work that puts money in pockets and ribeyes on tables; Cattlemen&apos;s Steakhouse, open since 1910, sits hard by the Oklahoma National Stockyards; Junior&apos;s Supper Club, owned by the Shumsky family.</desc><category lang="en">Travel</category><category lang="en">Food</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p15917551_b_v11_ab.jpg"/></programme>
