<programme start="20261022100000 +0000" stop="20261022110000 +0000" channel="OWN"><title lang="en">Hoarding: Buried Alive</title><sub-title lang="en">I&apos;m a Rockstar, Baby!</sub-title><desc lang="en">As the lead singer for a rock band, Kelly Jay has lived quite a life, and he has collected a massive hoard to prove it; with his family ready to call it quits, Kelly must choose between his clutter and the people he loves.</desc><category lang="en">Reality TV</category><category lang="en">Documentary</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-PG</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p8030007_b_v8_ap.jpg"/></programme>
